1
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:11,160
If you are truly honorable and keep your promises,

2
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:12,840
then give me my sister's medicine.

3
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,720
Give me the medicine, and I'll die without complaint.

4
00:01:14,720 --> 00:01:16,120
Don't you want to kill me?

5
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,020
Come on.

6
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:19,560
I understand now.

7
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:22,920
You are provoking me into giving you the medicine.

8
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:26,080
Daoist, we had a deal.

9
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:28,800
You'd give me the medicine once we left Wuyou City.

10
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:30,800
My sister's illness really can't be delayed any longer.

11
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:31,520
You know...

12
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,360
I promised you.

13
00:01:34,759 --> 00:01:35,960
Help us complete the mission,

14
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:38,420
and I will naturally hand over the medicine.

15
00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:41,360
I knew you were going to complete the Master of Wuyou Cave's mission,

16
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:42,690
so I waited here for you.

17
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:43,880
I heard some news

18
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:46,180
related to Wuyou City.

19
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:47,580
Want to hear it?

20
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:49,400
What news?

21
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:51,080
Give me the medicine.

22
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,009
You speak first.

23
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:53,080
You give it first.

24
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,400
Speak.

25
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:15,760
Someone is going to assassinate the Emperor,

26
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:16,720
but it's not you.

27
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,160
Aunt Yi'an,

28
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,090
something happened to Han.

29
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:26,040
Tonight, my sister was supposed to see me off on a boat.

30
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:26,840
On the way,

31
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,920
we suddenly encountered an inspection by the Imperial City Department.

32
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:30,120
I got off the carriage

33
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:32,040
and went to the pier. When I looked for my sister again,

34
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:32,900
the driver said

35
00:02:33,079 --> 00:02:34,880
a group of thugs suddenly rushed out

36
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:36,880
and kidnapped my sister and Zhu'er.

37
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:37,960
What?

38
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:40,720
I heard that at the pier,

39
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:44,320
women are often kidnapped and smuggled out of Dongjing by boat.

40
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:45,600
The boat hasn't left yet.

41
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:46,440
Those thugs

42
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,130
couldn't have gone far.

43
00:02:49,079 --> 00:02:50,680
My current identity is awkward.

44
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,760
I ask Aunt Yi'an

45
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:54,720
to immediately ask the guards to rescue my sister.

46
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:55,960
At this hour,

47
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:57,490
where can I find guards?

48
00:02:59,240 --> 00:02:59,840
Lord Zhou.

49
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,520
Go find Lord Zhou.

50
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:03,760
I just wrote

51
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:05,560
this letter in the carriage.

52
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,720
Please give it to him, Aunt.

53
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:09,180
He will definitely be able to save my sister.

54
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:12,410
I don't know what you and Han are doing,

55
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:13,840
but disregarding your own safety

56
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,360
is definitely a big mistake.

57
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,490
When she comes back,

58
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:17,400
I will punish her severely.

59
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,000
Men,

60
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:19,900
prepare the carriage.

61
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,240
Hurry up.

62
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,200
Hurry up.

63
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,240
Hurry.

64
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:25,079
Go.

65
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,010
Stop crying.

66
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:48,020
Check the whole cellar immediately.

67
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,680
Check all these women

68
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,480
as well.

69
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,240
Yes.

70
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,080
Nothing unusual in the cellar.

71
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,760
The number of women and smuggled salt match.

72
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:13,620
There's nothing unusual either.

73
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:14,490
Holy Master,

74
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:16,660
we just received this secret report.

75
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,760
Those Liangshan rebels

76
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:22,200
are probably not going to attack the merchant ships, but the cellar.

77
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,480
Time is too tight.

78
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,600
To transfer all this smuggled salt

79
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:26,800
and these women,

80
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:28,440
I'm afraid

81
00:04:29,280 --> 00:04:30,280
it's impossible.

82
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:33,440
If they really have the ability to expose this smuggled salt

83
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:35,320
and the women trafficking,

84
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:36,960
then put on a show,

85
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,960
and frame

86
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:42,720
that corrupt official Zhu Mian from the imperial court as the mastermind.

87
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,440
Please instruct me, Holy Master,

88
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,440
what should

89
00:04:46,200 --> 00:04:47,159
I do?

90
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:49,810
Do you recognize these two people?

91
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:55,520
Lord Zhu Mian's favorite concubine.

92
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,720
The owner of Yunxiang Pavilion.

93
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,400
These two had an affair

94
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:03,240
and tried to escape Zhu Mian's control.

95
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:06,320
Let's use them as a warning to others.

96
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,160
Spare my life!

97
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:07,880
Shopkeeper Lou,

98
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:09,080
spare me!

99
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:10,580
You are wise, Holy Master.

100
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,820
Spare me, Shopkeeper Lou.

101
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,160
Shopkeeper Lou, please spare us.

102
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:14,840
Shopkeeper Lou.

103
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:15,920
Please have mercy.

104
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:17,280
Now you know to be afraid?

105
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,810
What were you doing before?

106
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,280
Shopkeeper Lou.

107
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,200
At this hour,

108
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,620
Yunxiang Pavilion is full of guests.

109
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,600
If we bring the abducted women to the main hall

110
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,760
and draw a crowd,

111
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,640
this scheme will be exposed.

112
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:38,440
Then our mission will be accomplished.

113
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:40,920
That's simple.

114
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:44,409
Chen Wu, you guard the door.

115
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:45,800
Brother Li Lang,

116
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,860
gather the guests.

117
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,580
That way, we can get this done.

118
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:53,840
Before tonight,

119
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:55,240
one of these two wretches

120
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:57,840
was Lord Zhu Mian's favorite concubine.

121
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:58,880
The other

122
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:02,320
is the popular owner of Yunxiang Pavilion.

123
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:06,120
Just because they conspired to escape from Dongjing City,

124
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,600
they ended up like this.

125
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:12,400
Neither the favorite concubine nor the owner could escape.

126
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,600
All of you,

127
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:15,680
no matter your status,

128
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:17,680
their fate

129
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:19,560
will be your fate.

130
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:40,040
Come in, please.

131
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:43,800
Thank you.

132
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:44,960
Please take a seat.

133
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:46,159
I'll get you some tea.

134
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,960
Enjoy, sir.

135
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:03,200
My lady.

136
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:09,560
Don't be afraid, sisters.

137
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,690
She's already dead.

138
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:12,600
That woman

139
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,960
who just beat someone to death in front of us

140
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,200
wants us to believe

141
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:18,000
that the one who abducted us tonight

142
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,920
is that scumbag official Zhu Mian.

143
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,650
Zhu Mian is indeed detestable,

144
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:24,280
and might even have participated in this illegal trade.

145
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:26,280
But the one actually doing the illegal trade tonight

146
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:27,480
is someone else.

147
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:29,760
This is the cellar of Yunxiang Pavilion.

148
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:31,600
There must be ambushes everywhere outside.

149
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:33,000
Once we get out,

150
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:34,760
run towards the banquet hall.

151
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:35,640
There are many people there.

152
00:07:35,640 --> 00:07:36,700
Just shout loudly,

153
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:37,480
"Murder!"

154
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,920
Someone will definitely come to save us.

155
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:40,720
Understood?

156
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,960
Really?

157
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:44,600
I'm scared.

158
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:47,080
Is that clear?

159
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,400
Clear.

160
00:07:48,760 --> 00:07:49,560
Is that clear?

161
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,400
Go.

162
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,080
Murder!

163
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,120
Help!

164
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,280
Murder!

165
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:56,720
Help!

166
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,920
Murder in the cellar!

167
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:00,760
Murder! Help!

168
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:04,200
Murder!

169
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:12,140
Go check it out, there's a commotion at Yunxiang Pavilion!

170
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:12,760
Hurry.

171
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,560
Hurry.

172
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:17,000
Help! Murder!

173
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,160
Help! Murder!

174
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:21,120
Save me!

175
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,560
Are you okay?

176
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:25,410
I'm fine.

177
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:26,840
Let's go.

178
00:08:27,200 --> 00:08:29,160
Murder! Help!

179
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:31,800
Hurry.

180
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,240
Help! Murder here!

181
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,880
Murder! Help!

182
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,480
Something happened in Yunxiang Pavilion.

183
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:40,000
Right here, hurry.

184
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:46,000
My lord.

185
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:48,120
It's confirmed that the villains are in the pavilion.

186
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:50,180
Please block all exits immediately.

187
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,200
Sanniangzi.

188
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:56,200
If Li Yi'an hadn't come forward to testify,

189
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:59,080
I would be deploying troops without authorization.

190
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:01,960
If we really catch the assassins and make a merit, that's fine.

191
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:04,200
If we cause trouble and make a mistake,

192
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:06,620
I will definitely hold you responsible.

193
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:07,960
Don't worry, my lord.

194
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,600
You will definitely make a merit this time.

195
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:12,920
At the very least, you saved the female members of the Zhao family.

196
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:14,380
If you catch the villains,

197
00:09:14,920 --> 00:09:16,720
it will be an even greater merit.

198
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:18,080
Alright.

199
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:19,960
I'll trust you this once.
